# Cache on page refresh

When adding or changing persisted client state (`localStorage` / `sessionStorage`):

1. Use the `lockin_police_` prefix (see `src/lib/storage.ts`).
2. On full page reload, call `resetAppCacheOnPageReload()` from `src/lib/cacheReset.ts` before reading restored session data (see `LockInPolice` mount effect).
3. Do not restore active sessions after a reload unless product requirements change — refresh should start clean.

Camera/media code must release `MediaStream` tracks on `pagehide` and component unmount to avoid a stuck camera after reload.
